alpers as pointed out by  vgc amazon uk is one of the few  retailers where you can currently  purchase a first party wireless xbox  controller for the recommended retail  price but third-party sellers are  charging almost double with listing  prices starting at  115 dollars at the time of this  recording it doesn't appear that there's  any stock issues in the us with the  microsoft store and best buy still  selling controllers though as pointed  out by vgc amazon us and gamestop are  only selling pre-owned controllers  meaning there might be some stock issues  in some places now switching gears from  hardware to software call of duty has  seen a lot of major hollywood  collaborations over the last few years  including horror movie icons like billy  the puppet and leatherface and most  recently the godzilla in king kong  monsterverse crossover for vanguard and  warzone now it seems the terminator  could be popping up for call of duty  season 4. the call of duty twitter  account shared a new promo teaser for  season 4 which says quote looks like  some mercenary scored an unusual hall  some precious metals shine brighter in  the darkness who can identify the tweet  includes an image of gold bars which  fits the mercenaries of fortune themed  for season 4. however one bar isn't gold  and as charlie intel pointed out  increasing the exposure on the image  will reveal the word skynet on the lone  silver bar mentions of skynet the ai  system that served up the apocalypse in  the popular sci-fi franchise likely  means call of duty will receive some  sort of terminator operator bundle for  vanguard and warzone according to  charlie intel there will actually be two  one with the t800 and one with the t1000  are you excited for terminator and call  of duty or do you really want call of  duty to team up with some more  current characters let me know in the  comments below and i'll see you tomorrow
 

